  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Noun + (の) + ごとき + Noun\nNoun + ごとく + Adjective/Verb",
      "html": "Noun + (の) + ごとき + Noun<br/>Noun + ごとく + Adjective/Verb",
      "credits_raw": "blabby",
      "content_sha256": "90a541da6a1d03d875ab9ab1f0a9a3184f086642d15c7be0598ddcc6759768f8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Not to be confused with <b>ことごとく</b>, which is an unrelated word meaning 'entirely':\n\n　ことごとく信じる。\n Believe something totally.",
      "html": "Not to be confused with &lt;b&gt;ことごとく&lt;/b&gt;, which is an unrelated word meaning 'entirely':<br/><br/>　ことごとく信じる。<br/> Believe something totally.",
      "credits_raw": "mochabean",
      "content_sha256": "3b91d4a0f32f1807c5d0a840504a8dbffb474d88d3b9696436fdb5c8f420d607",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Ref # Kanzen Master Level 1 - p62 - no.53",
      "html": "<b>Ref #</b> Kanzen Master Level 1 - p62 - no.53",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "0f10bd6d598eb0269d739976edbbdb73609fdf6fa7d443b1c54872258815e629",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Ref # A Dictionary of Advanced Japanese Grammar p103",
      "html": "<b>Ref #</b> A Dictionary of Advanced Japanese Grammar p103",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "79829f0c1fe6459584675c65da83b86383cb53f832c6dec034e2f61dd366aec1",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Written, Formal",
      "html": "Written, Formal",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "e812337f1b8823a6369b3eb26877e5ca9302a82e9afff1e1fb761d18244c72b5",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ごとし indicates similarity. It changes form depending on where it is in a sentence, it's nuance/grammatical function, and whether it is attached to a verb or a noun.",
      "html": "ごとし indicates similarity. It changes form depending on where it is in a sentence, it's nuance/grammatical function, and whether it is attached to a verb or a noun.",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "5de5fb58ac40d29e32d671613b828310aa84712b64bc5ea91bccb611697ba6dc",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "One of the functions of ごとし / ごとき / ごとく is to mark a simile.",
      "html": "One of the functions of ごとし / ごとき / ごとく is to mark a simile.",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "f7ad5fea5361098c63b8cb7827d3772f032e41dd0246e06a76ca08429e17c227",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "When か is inserted, it adds the nuance of doubt on the part of the speaker.",
      "html": "When か is inserted, it adds the nuance of doubt on the part of the speaker.",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "85123ca2f80b57255ba254b6f0d9b91bd45bb8d6f3464c6620a5c96ce0a87998",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Used almost exclusively in written language.",
      "html": "Used almost exclusively in written language.",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "3e794c43480fc32a1cfbe245cfa4b09f8db17ef93dc5506c355b92f1f25730fc",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 9,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Set Phrases\n\n上述のごとく\nAs stated above\n\n当然のごとく\nAs if it were a matter of course",
      "html": "<b>Set Phrases</b><br/><br/><strong>上述のごとく</strong><br/>As stated above<br/><br/><strong>当然のごとく</strong><br/>As if it were a matter of course",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "00828278b5810ac1e7f682c2ba9be95656a8c09b2c4aaa8f65d4f4caf51d1c18",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 10,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "{NOUN} + のごとし[魚のごとし - s.o. is like a fish]\n{VERBnon-past} + (が/かの) + ごとし[夢見るがかのごとし - as if s.o. were dreaming]\n\n{NOUN} + (か) + のごとく[魚かのごとく泳ぐ s.o. swims as if they were a fish]\n\n{NOUN} + (か) + ごとき + {NOUN}[夢のごとき人生 life like a dream]\n{NOUN である / VERBnon-past} + (が/かの) ごとき + {NOUN}[山に登る (が/かの) ごとき人生 life like climbing a mountain]",
      "html": "<table><br/><tr><td>{NOUN} + <strong>のごとし</strong></td><td>[魚のごとし - s.o. is like a fish]</td></tr><br/><tr><td>{VERBnon-past} + (が/かの) + <strong>ごとし</strong></td><td>[夢見るがかのごとし - as if s.o. were dreaming]</td></tr><br/><tr></tr><br/><tr><td>{NOUN} + (か) + のごとく</td><td>[魚かのごとく泳ぐ s.o. swims as if they were a fish]</td></tr><br/><tr></tr><br/><tr><td>{NOUN} + (か) + ごとき + {NOUN}</td><td>[夢のごとき人生 life like a dream]</td></tr><br/><tr><td>{NOUN である / VERBnon-past} + (が/かの) ごとき + {NOUN}</td><td>[山に登る (が/かの) ごとき人生 life like climbing a mountain]</td></tr><br/></table>",
      "credits_raw": "LR",
      "content_sha256": "40261a3fd6aec9bb4da05ef3a46ec504a8090243f27b2aaa9b2ddbc076675968",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 11,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "生けるかのごとく",
      "html": "生けるかのごとく",
      "credits_raw": "誠",
